  "description": "Tree: Mature Swamp Cypress (marked as 'T1')\rLocation: Back garden, ~13?14?m from house\rReason for Work: Canopy management to maintain tree health and safe proportionate size; moderate reduction to reduce canopy mass and wind loading; cyclical management of a mature tree in a constrained garden setting.\r\rWorks Proposed:\r\rReduce crown by approximately 2-3?metres in height and lateral spread (not exceeding 20?25% of live crown volume).\r\rRetain the natural conical shape and balanced branch framework.\r\rRemove any dead, crossing, or damaged branches.\r\r\rJustification / Additional Notes:\r\rThe tree has not been managed for approximately 7 years.\r\rThe works are moderate and proportionate for a tree of this size and species.",
